return {
    ["      戴莉笑了，旋即在朦胧的视线里看见了那个身穿黑色风衣，发际线较高，有幽邃灰眸的男人，看见他以手按胸，弯腰伸掌，邀请自己跳舞。\n      她探出了自己的手，她的思绪随之变得滞涩。\n      穿黑风衣的灰眸男人拉起了异变逐渐退去的戴莉，在伦纳德的目光中，在喷泉乱流的破败广场里，跳起了轻快的舞蹈。"] = "      Daly smiled, and in her hazy vision, she saw the man in the black trench coat with the high hairline and deep gray eyes. She saw him press a hand to his chest, bow, and extend his palm, inviting her to dance.\n      She reached out her hand, and her thoughts became filled with Stagnation.\n      The gray-eyed man in the black trench coat pulled up Daly, whose mutations were gradually receding. Under Leonard's gaze, in the dilapidated square amidst the turbulent fountain, they began to Dance a lighthearted dance.",
