    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绒绒熊耳朵】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>风尚回廊饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得绒绒熊耳朵，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>风尚回廊</>收集进度解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Bear Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Bear Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress unlock.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>金纺线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍：</>\n1、使用金纺线可在<Assistant_System>秘偶-获取秘偶-乌托邦剧院</>界面抽选秘偶。\n2、乌托邦剧院戏台每次<Assistant_Property1>刷新</>会上架<Assistant_Red>3个</>秘偶，可供抽选。若抽选后戏台上只剩<Assistant_Red>紫色</>品质秘偶，戏台会自动刷新。\n序幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*3，从台上3个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n中幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*6，从台上剩余2个秘偶中随机获得1个。\n落幕抽选：消耗<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>*12，必定获得台上剩余的1个秘偶。\n3、可以通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货</>中的各类商店兑换，<Assistant_System>商城-交易所</>购买，<Assistant_System>段位奖励</>等途径获得。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[获取秘偶]|536}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Gold Spun Thread</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Item Description:</>\n1. Use Gold Spun Thread in the <Assistant_System>Marionette - Obtain Marionette - Utopia Theater</> interface to draw marionettes.\n2. The Utopia Theater stage will <Assistant_Property1>refresh</> and list <Assistant_Red>3</> marionettes available for selection each time. If only <Assistant_Red>Purple</> quality marionettes remain on stage after a draw, the stage will automatically refresh.\nPrologue Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Spun Thread</>*3 to randomly obtain 1 of the 3 marionettes on stage.\nIntermission Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Spun Thread</>*6 to randomly obtain 1 of the 2 remaining marionettes on stage.\nCurtain Call Draw: Consumes <Assistant_Property1>Gold Spun Thread</>*12 to guarantee the acquisition of the 1 remaining marionette on stage.\n3. Can be obtained through various shops in <Assistant_System>Mall - General Store</>, purchases in <Assistant_System>Mall - Exchange</>, <Assistant_System>Rank Rewards</>, and other pathways.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Obtain Marionette]|536}",
    ["<Highlight>非凡聚合</>：可以将两个非凡物质聚合成一个新的非凡物质。\n<Highlight>词条继承</>：非凡聚合时，聚合产物词条会<Highlight>全部</>从<Highlight>放入的非凡物质</>的词条中随机选取。\n<Highlight>词条异变</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有极小概率出现异变，生成异变词条，放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数量与类型不同时，可以出现的异变词条不同。每次聚合，如果未出异变，会使后续聚合触发异变的概率提高。\n<Highlight>词条升级</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有概率触发词条升级，部分词条的属性值提升。\n<Highlight>高级聚合</>：当前持有的4词条及以上攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁4词条攻击非凡物质放入聚合；当前持有的5词条攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁5词条非凡物质放入聚合。\n<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>：进行非凡物质聚合时会提升<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>，聚合熟练度赛季重置，达到一定值后可以获得奖励。"] = "<Highlight> Beyonder Aggregation </>: You can aggregate two Beyonder materials into a new Beyonder material. \n <Highlight> Affix Inheritance </>: During Beyonder aggregation, the affixes of the resulting product will be <Highlight> all </> randomly selected from the affixes of the <Highlight> Beyonder materials </> put in. \n <Highlight> Affix Mutation </>: When the total number of affixes of the Beyonder materials put into the aggregation is 6 or more, there is a very small probability of mutation occurring after aggregation, generating a mutated affix. If the total quantity and types of affixes of the Beyonder materials put into the aggregation are different, the mutated affixes that can appear will be different. Each time you aggregate, if no mutation occurs, the probability of triggering a mutation in subsequent aggregations will increase. \n <Highlight> Affix Upgrade </>: When the total number of affixes of the Beyonder materials put into the aggregation is 6 or more, there is a probability of triggering an affix upgrade after aggregation, increasing the attribute values of some affixes. \n <Highlight> Advanced Aggregation </>: When you currently possess 2 Attack Beyonder materials with 4 or more affixes and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 4 or more affixes, you unlock the ability to put 4-affix Attack Beyonder materials into aggregation; when you currently possess 2 Attack Beyonder materials with 5 affixes and 2 Defense Beyonder materials with 5 affixes, you unlock the ability to put 5-affix Beyonder materials into aggregation. \n <Highlight> Aggregation Proficiency </>: Performing Beyonder material aggregation will increase <Highlight> Aggregation Proficiency </>. Aggregation Proficiency resets each season, and you can receive rewards after reaching a certain value.",
